            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A hitherto unreported treatment for one of the manifestations of the hyoid syndrome is excision of the tip of the hyoid greater cornu. A greater &quot;index of suspicion&quot; for the hyoid syndrome is urged.</AbstractText>
